# Club de Fans (C4a, contract 39), 10 x 8, interior. column = i, row = j. The chairman talks at length about his beloved (a pet that he cannot show off) and
# gives the BIKE COUPON (`cupon_bici`, flag 78) to whoever listens; two fans, posters on the wall, a table with cups. Contract 65: the second fan (`fan_b`) is the FRIENDSHIP EVALUATOR (happiness
# lady): he reads the lead creature's friendship in five tiers (script `fan_bond`).
@map club_fans
@size 10 8
@interior yes
@flag clt_done 931   # F2 (contract 74): the voltgecko-for-voltspool trade was done
@var clt_res 12
@var clt_want 10
@var clt_give 11
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 6 N
@flag vale_given 78
@var bond_t 4
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  object=bookshelf text=club.poster.a interact=look
  f  object=bookshelf text=club.poster.b interact=look
  g  object=bookshelf text=club.poster.c interact=look
  h  npc=vecino_m id=chair face=SW script=chairman
  i  object=table
  j  npc=mama id=fan_a face=E text=club.fan.a
  k  npc=vecino_m id=fan_b face=W script=fan_bond
  l  object=flowerbed
  m  tile=mat
  n  tile=floor_wood npc=rider id=biker face=N script=biker
@grid
  abbcbbcbbb
  def....g..
  d....h....
  d...i.....
  d.j....k..
  d.......l.
  d.....n...
  d...mm....
@warp m -> metropolis_neon spawn=club_door
# The chairman: he talks and talks; whoever listens to the end gets the Bike Coupon (once: the coupon is in the bag, flag 78). A full bag: he hands it over next time.
@script chairman npc
    npc_face_hero chair
    jf vale_given said
    say club.chair.hi
    say club.chair.t1
    say club.chair.t2
    say club.chair.t3
    say club.chair.offer
    give_item cupon_bici 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 cupon_bici
    say gl.gift
    setf vale_given
    say club.chair.about
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  said:
    say club.chair.after
@end
# The friendship evaluator (contract 65): the club's usual line, then how much the LEAD creature (party slot 0) likes the player: `bond tier` = 0 cold (< 50), 1 wary (< 100), 2 friendly (< 150),
# 3 fond (< 220), 4 devoted (220+, what the friendship evolutions need), 255 = no creature. {v0} = the creature's name (nickname or species).
@script fan_bond npc
    npc_face_hero fan_b
    say club.fan.b
    say club.fanb.hi
    bond tier bond_t
    jv bond_t 255 none
    jv bond_t 0 t0
    jv bond_t 1 t1
    jv bond_t 2 t2
    jv bond_t 3 t3
    say club.fanb.t4
    end
  none:
    say club.fanb.none
    end
  t0:
    say club.fanb.t0
    end
  t1:
    say club.fanb.t1
    end
  t2:
    say club.fanb.t2
    end
  t3:
    say club.fanb.t3
@end

# F2 (contract 74): an in-game trade (voltgecko -> voltspool, for a creature), nickname = the fixed ASCII text `tr_club.nick` (the same in all four languages, contract 32.5). Flag 931 = it was done.
@script biker npc
    npc_face_hero biker
    setv clt_want sp:voltgecko
    setv clt_give sp:voltspool
    name_var 0 clt_want
    name_var 1 clt_give
    jf clt_done after
    say tr_club.hello
    ask trueque.ask
    jv 0 1 go
    say trueque.no
    end
  go:
    trade voltgecko voltspool tr_club.nick clt_res
    jv clt_res 1 done
    jv clt_res 255 cancel
    say trueque.wrong
    end
  cancel:
    say trueque.no
    end
  done:
    setf clt_done
    say trueque.done
    end
  after:
    name_var 0 clt_give
    say trueque.after
@end
